      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hector%2C_New_York",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hector was carved out of Ovid in 1802, shifted to Seneca County in 1804, and finally settled in Schuyler County in 1854.",
